    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · Posts – Draft & Approval\nWeekdays 8 am (or manual): pause check → plan slots (posts_per_day, ≥4 h gap, working hours) → AI Agent (Gemini) writes post + image prompt → Posts row **pending** → CometAPI image → preview email (text + image) → Gmail Approve/Reject → if approved, image uploaded to LinkedIn (image_urn) → **approved / rejected** → Logs.\n\nImage or LinkedIn upload failing never blocks the post: it continues text-only. Workflow 2 publishes at the slot.",
